nds]] peeled and deveined jumbo [[Cookbook:Shrimp|shrimp]]\n* Freshly-squeezed [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n* [[Cookbook:All-purpose flour|All-purpose flour]]\n* [[Cookbook:Cornmeal|Cornmeal]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Quart|quarts]] [[Cookbook:Vegetable oil|neutral oil]], for [[Cookbook:Frying|frying]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine salt, pepper, Cajun seasoning, and cayenne. Set aside.\n#[[Cookbook:Dredging|Dredge]] each shrimp in flour, dip in lemon juice, and then dip into cornmeal. Let sit 2–3 minutes.\n#Heat oil to 375°F. Add shrimp in batches, and cook about 2 minutes or until golden brown and cooked through. Drain on a [[Cookbook:Cooling Rack|wire rack]].\n#Once all shrimp has been fried, [[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|toss]] with seasoning mixture. Serve immediately.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using shrimp]]\n[[Category:Deep fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornmeal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Dynamite Shrimp","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"3 tbsp salt","sourceText":"3 tbsp salt","amountText":"3 tbsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3 tbsp freshly-ground black pepper","sourceText":"3 tbsp freshly-ground black pepper","amountText":"3 tbsp freshly-ground black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tbsp Cajun seasoning","sourceText":"1 tbsp Cajun seasoning","amountText":"1 tbsp Cajun seasoning","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tbsp cayenne pepper","sourceText":"1 tbsp cayenne pepper","amountText":"1 tbsp cayenne pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 ½ pounds peeled and deveined jumbo shrimp","sourceText":"